==English==
===Etymology===
Via Middle English from Old French ''estaple'', of Germanic origin

===Pronunciation===
*:Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-eɪpəl|-eɪpəl]]

====Noun====
'''staple'''

#A [[basic]] or [[essential]] [[supply]]; especially a basic [[food]].
#:''Rice is a '''staple''' in the diet of many cultures.''

